    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "The all-camps behavior is restored. The mod now starts one missing smoke effect per second until every saved campsite has one, instead of creating all 13 in one frame. In the installed Story test, the log reached 13 live effects with none missing, remained there after 105 seconds, passed 9,548 script ticks with no stalls, and produced no ScriptHook exception. The remaining check is visual: confirm distant inactive smoke is black, active smoke is white, and deleting a campsite removes its plume.",
